      "title": "Investigation assessment",
      "detail": "Checkout is returning HTTP 503 with no origin telemetry. The service dependency graph shows checkout depends on payments and inventory, which in turn depend on ledger and notifications. However, no diagnostics are available for payments or ledger, and current policies block all recovery actions due to missing origin logs and request traces. Without these, no supported action\u2014such as rollback, feature flag disable, or restart\u2014can be justified. The incident requires origin-level diagnostic evidence before any remediation can be proposed.",
